{
  "model": "vidu-q4/reference-to-video",
  "openapi": {
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
      "title": "kie.ai",
      "description": "kie.ai API 文档",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "contact": {
        "name": "技术支持",
        "email": "support@kie.ai"
      }
    },
    "tags": [],
    "paths": {
      "/api/v1/jobs/createTask": {
        "post": {
          "summary": "Vidu Q4 Reference To Video",
          "deprecated": false,
          "description": "\n## Query Task Status\nAfter submitting the task, you can check the progress of the task and obtain the generated results through the unified query endpoint: \n<Card title=\"Get Task Details\" icon=\"lucide-search\" href=\"/market/common/get-task-detail\">\n Learn how to check the task status and obtain the generated results \n</Card> \n\n::: tip[]\nIn the production environment, it is recommended to use the \"callBackUrl\" parameter to receive the automatic notification upon completion of the generation, rather than polling the status endpoint. \n:::\n\nRelated resources\n<CardGroup cols={2}>\n  <Card title=\"Market Overview\" icon=\"lucide-store\" href=\"/market/quickstart\"> View all available models </Card>\n  <Card title=\"General API\" icon=\"lucide-cog\" href=\"/common-api/get-account-credits\"> View account credits and usage </Card>\n</CardGroup>",
          "operationId": "vidu-q4-reference-to-video",
          "tags": [],
          "parameters": [],
          "requestBody": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": [
                    "model",
                    "input"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "model": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "vidu-q4/reference-to-video"
                      ],
                      "default": "vidu-q4/reference-to-video",
                      "description": "The model name used for generation. This endpoint must use `vidu-q4/reference-to-video`."
                    },
                    "callBackUrl": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "uri",
                      "examples": [
                        "https://your-domain.com/api/callback"
                      ],
                      "description": "The URL to receive generation task completion updates. Optional but recommended for production use. The system POSTs the task status and results to this URL when generation completes."
                    },
                    "input": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "description": "Input parameters for the generation task.",
                      "properties": {
                        "prompt": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "maxLength": 20000,
                          "description": "Text description of the video. Refer to inputs by order, e.g. \"the man in reference image 2 says ... using reference audio 1\". Up to 20,000 characters."
                        },
                        "duration": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "minimum": 3,
                          "maximum": 16,
                          "default": 5,
                          "description": "Video length in seconds. Integer from 3 to 16. "
                        },
                        "resolution": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "540p",
                            "720p",
                            "1080p",
                            "2k",
                            "4k"
                          ],
                          "default": "720p",
                          "description": "Output resolution. "
                        },
                        "audio": {
                          "type": "boolean",
                          "default": true,
                          "description": "Generate synchronized audio (dialogue and sound effects). Set false for a silent video."
                        },
                        "reference_image_urls": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "minItems": 1,
                          "maxItems": 15,
                          "items": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "pattern": "^https?://.+"
                          },
                          "description": "Reference image URLs (http/https), 1 to 15. JPG, JPEG, PNG or WEBP."
                        },
                        "reference_audio_urls": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "maxItems": 3,
                          "items": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "pattern": "^https?://.+"
                          },
                          "description": "Optional reference audio URLs (http/https), up to 3. MP3 only, each 3-12 seconds and up to 50 MB."
                        },
                        "aspect_ratio": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "16:9",
                            "9:16",
                            "1:1",
                            "4:3",
                            "3:4"
                          ],
                          "default": "16:9",
                          "description": "Output aspect ratio."
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "prompt",
                        "reference_image_urls"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "model": "vidu-q4/reference-to-video",
                  "callBackUrl": "https://your-domain.com/api/callback",
                  "input": {
                    "prompt": "In the scene of reference image 1, the person in reference image 2 turns to the person in reference image 3 and says: \"What are you doing?\"",
                    "reference_image_urls": [
                      "https://static.aiquickdraw.com/tools/example/vidu-q4-ref-1.png",
                      "https://static.aiquickdraw.com/tools/example/vidu-q4-ref-2.png",
                      "https://static.aiquickdraw.com/tools/example/vidu-q4-ref-3.png"
                    ],
                    "duration": 5,
                    "resolution": "1080p",
                    "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
                    "audio": true
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "required": true
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Request successful",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "code": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "enum": [
                          200,
                          400,
                          401,
                          402,
                          404,
                          422,
                          429,
                          455,
                          500,
                          501,
                          505
                        ],
                        "description": "Status code of the request. The HTTP status is 200 even when the request fails, so always check this field: 200 means success; any other value means the request failed and msg describes the reason. Common values: 401 invalid or missing API key; 402 insufficient credits; 429 rate limit exceeded; 422 or 500 the request could not be processed (read msg and check your parameters before retrying)."
                      },
                      "msg": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Error message when code != 200",
                        "examples": [
                          "success"
                        ]
                      },
                      "data": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "taskId": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Task ID, can be used with [Get Task Details](/market/common/get-task-detail) endpoint to query task status",
                            "examples": [
                              "task_abcdef123456"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "example": {
                    "code": 200,
                    "msg": "success",
                    "data": {
                      "taskId": "task_abcdef123456"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "500": {
              "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error",
              "description": "Server error."
            }
          },
          "security": [
            {
              "BearerAuth": []
            }
          ],
          "callbacks": {
            "videoTaskCompleted": {
              "{$request.body#/callBackUrl}": {
                "post": {
                  "description": "The system sends this callback when the `vidu-q4/reference-to-video` task succeeds or fails.",
                  "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                      "application/json": {
                        "schema": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "required": [
                            "code",
                            "msg",
                            "data"
                          ],
                          "properties": {
                            "code": {
                              "type": "integer",
                              "enum": [
                                200,
                                501
                              ],
                              "description": "Unified callback code: 200 for success, 501 for failure."
                            },
                            "msg": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "Unified callback message."
                            },
                            "data": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "required": [
                                "taskId",
                                "model",
                                "state",
                                "param"
                              ],
                              "properties": {
                                "taskId": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "description": "The unique task identifier."
                                },
                                "model": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "enum": [
                                    "vidu-q4/reference-to-video"
                                  ],
                                  "description": "The model used for the task."
                                },
                                "state": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "enum": [
                                    "success",
                                    "fail"
                                  ],
                                  "description": "Terminal task state."
                                },
                                "param": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "description": "JSON string containing the submitted task parameters."
                                },
                                "resultJson": {
                                  "type": [
                                    "string",
                                    "null"
                                  ],
                                  "description": "JSON string containing resultUrls when successful. Present only when state is success."
                                },
                                "failCode": {
                                  "type": [
                                    "string",
                                    "null"
                                  ],
                                  "description": "Failure code. Present only when state is fail."
                                },
                                "failMsg": {
                                  "type": [
                                    "string",
                                    "null"
                                  ],
                                  "description": "Failure reason. Present only when state is fail."
                                },
                                "costTime": {
                                  "type": "integer",
                                  "format": "int64",
                                  "description": "Processing time in seconds."
                                },
                                "completeTime": {
                                  "type": "integer",
                                  "format": "int64",
                                  "description": "Task completion timestamp."
                                },
                                "createTime": {
                                  "type": "integer",
                                  "format": "int64",
                                  "description": "Task creation timestamp."
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "responses": {
                    "200": {
                      "description": "Return 200 to acknowledge."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "webhooks": {},
    "components": {
      "schemas": {},
      "responses": {
        "Error": {
          "description": "Server error.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "code": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "Response status code\n\n- **200**: Success - Request has been processed successfully\n- **401**: Unauthorized - Authentication credentials are missing or invalid\n- **402**: Insufficient Credits - Account does not have enough credits to perform the operation\n- **404**: Not Found - The requested resource or endpoint does not exist\n- **408**: Timeout - No result has been returned for over 10 minutes.\n- **422**: Validation Error - The request parameters failed validation checks\n- **429**: Rate Limited - Request limit has been exceeded for this resource\n- **455**: Service Unavailable - System is currently undergoing maintenance\n- **500**: Server Error - An unexpected error occurred while processing the request\n- **501**: Generation Failed - Content generation task failed\n- **505**: Feature Disabled - The requested feature is currently disabled"
                  },
                  "msg": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Response message, error description when failed"
                  },
                  "data": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {}
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "code",
                  "msg",
                  "data"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "Example 1": {
                  "summary": "Example 1",
                  "value": {
                    "code": 500,
                    "msg": "Server Error - An unexpected error occurred while processing the request"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "securitySchemes": {
        "BearerAuth": {
          "type": "http",
          "scheme": "bearer",
          "bearerFormat": "API Key",
          "description": "All API requests require a Bearer Token. Add the header `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY` to authenticate requests."
        }
      }
    },
    "servers": [
      {
        "url": "https://api.kie.ai",
        "description": "正式环境"
      }
    ],
    "security": [
      {
        "BearerAuth": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
